From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shirogane Tsumugi <inapp@iccmc.cc>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 03:59:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/13] iommu: sunxi: add IOMMU driver for Allwinner D1/T113

Ported from the linux-next work by TaterLi/Wenting. Adapted to the 7.x
iommu_domain_ops: attach_dev() now receives the domain being replaced.

The D1's DE and VE reach memory through this IOMMU, which lets them use
non-contiguous buffers instead of pressuring CMA -- important on a board
with only 64MB of DRAM.
